  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NAM 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe to the bloody city! it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all full of lies",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "robbery; the prey departeth not;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The noise of a whip, and the noise of the rattling of the wheels, and of the pransing horses, and of the jumping chariots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The horseman lifteth up both the bright sword and the glittering spear: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a multitude of slain, and a great number of carcases; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none end of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "corpses; they stumble upon their corpses:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of the multitude of the whoredoms of the wellfavoured harlot, the mistress of witchcrafts, that selleth nations through her whoredoms, and families through her witchcrafts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against thee, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts; and I will discover thy skirts upon thy face, and I will shew the nations thy nakedness, and the kingdoms thy shame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will cast abominable filth upon thee, and make thee vile, and will set thee as a gazingstock.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all they that look upon thee shall flee from thee, and say, Nineveh is laid waste: who will bemoan her? whence shall I seek comforters for thee?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Art thou better than populous No, that was situate among the rivers,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that had",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the waters round about it, whose rampart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "her wall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the sea?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethiopia and Egypt",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "her strength, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "infinite; Put and Lubim were thy helpers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "she carried away, she went into captivity: her young children also were dashed in pieces at the top of all the streets: and they cast lots for her honourable men, and all her great men were bound in chains.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou also shalt be drunken: thou shalt be hid, thou also shalt seek strength because of the enemy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All thy strong holds",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fig trees with the firstripe figs: if they be shaken, they shall even fall into the mouth of the eater.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, thy people in the midst of thee",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "women: the gates of thy land shall be set wide open unto thine enemies: the fire shall devour thy bars.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw thee waters for the siege, fortify thy strong holds: go into clay, and tread the morter, make strong the brickkiln.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There shall the fire devour thee; the sword shall cut thee off, it shall eat thee up like the cankerworm: make thyself many as the cankerworm, make thyself many as the locusts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast multiplied thy merchants above the stars of heaven: the cankerworm spoileth, and flieth away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy crowned",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the locusts, and thy captains as the great grasshoppers, which camp in the hedges in the cold day,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.3.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when the sun ariseth they flee away, and their place is not known where they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
